          {
            "title": "Lesson #8",
            "id": 148385,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Completa la sintassi per chiamare la funzione <code>.filter()</code> sull'array <code>loot</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" startIndex=\"61\" endIndex=\"72\" isDefault=\"true\" /></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" loot = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;Torch&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Token&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Potion&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Trap&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" T = loot.filter(\" /><text value=\"element\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\" =&gt;\" /><text value=\" (element[\" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"] === \" /><text value=\"&quot;T&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"));\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(T);}\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di digitare <code>loot.filter</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #9",
            "id": 148386,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Aggiungi la dichiarazione della funzione inline e il parametro appropriato per popolare l'array <code>bossDamage</code> usando <code>.filter()</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" startIndex=\"85\" endIndex=\"100\" isDefault=\"true\" /></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" enemyDamage = [\" /><text value=\"99\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"56\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"78\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"110\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"29\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"58\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" bossDamage = enemyDamage.filter(\" /><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"total\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" total &gt; \" /><text value=\"80\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"});}\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di digitare <code>function(total)</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #10",
            "id": 148387,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Esamina i parametri e completa la sintassi in modo che <code>first3</code> memorizzi i primi tre nemici di <code>spawnQueue</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" startIndex=\"127\" endIndex=\"132\" isDefault=\"true\" /></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" spawnQueue = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;Slime&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Bat&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Goblin&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Orc&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Mage&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" first3 = spawnQueue.filter(\" /><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"name, index\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" index &lt; \" /><text value=\"3\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"});\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(first3);}\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di digitare <code>index</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #11",
            "id": 148388,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Perché passiamo una funzione come parametro all'interno di <code>.reduce()</code>?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Per dire alla funzione <code>.reduce()</code> come combinare i valori del gioco in un unico risultato</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Per indicare alla funzione <code>.reduce()</code> quale array modificare</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Per dire alla funzione <code>.reduce()</code> quali elementi mantenere o rimuovere</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Per dire alla funzione <code>.reduce()</code> come combinare i valori del gioco in un unico risultato.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #12",
            "id": 148389,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Completa la sintassi per chiamare la funzione <code>.reduce()</code> sull'array <code>coinPickups</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" startIndex=\"60\" endIndex=\"78\" isDefault=\"true\" /></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" coinPickups = [\" /><text value=\"20\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"21\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"12\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"13\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" totalCoins = coinPickups.reduce(\" /><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"prevVal, currVal\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" prevVal + currVal;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"});\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(totalCoins);}\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di digitare <code>coinPickups.reduce</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #13",
            "id": 148390,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Qual è il numero minimo di parametri necessari per far funzionare <code>.reduce()</code>?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">2</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">3</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">1</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere 2.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #14",
            "id": 148391,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Scrivi una arrow function che accetti due parametri (<code>prev</code> e <code>curr</code>) e restituisca la loro somma.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&lt;=\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"comboHits\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"67\" endIndex=\"68\" /><option startIndex=\"68\" endIndex=\"72\" /><option startIndex=\"72\" endIndex=\"73\" /><option startIndex=\"74\" endIndex=\"78\" /><option startIndex=\"78\" endIndex=\"79\" /><option startIndex=\"80\" endIndex=\"82\" /><option startIndex=\"83\" endIndex=\"94\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"var\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" comboHits = [\" /><text value=\"250\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"125\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"465\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"var\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" comboTotal = comboHits.reduce(\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"prev, curr\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") =&gt;\" /><text value=\" prev + curr);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(comboTotal);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>(</code>, seguito da <code>prev</code> e poi <code>,</code>, <code>curr</code>, <code>)</code>, <code>=&gt;</code>, <code>prev + curr</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #15",
            "id": 148392,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Dopo aver incluso due parametri nella funzione inline <code>.reduce()</code>, a quali valori danno accesso nella sintassi della funzione inline?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Il valore di riduzione precedente e il valore corrente dell'array</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Il valore corrente dell'array e il valore della riduzione precedente</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Il valore corrente dell'array e l'array chiamante</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Il valore di riduzione precedente e il valore corrente dell'array.</p></body></html>"
